TITLE Mix DIC and Ca solutions 1:1 and heat 20 to 200 C with calcite equil

SOLUTION 1 DIC solution
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 50

SOLUTION 2 Ca solution
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50

MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5
SAVE solution 10

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10 steps

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -pH true
    -temperature true
END
